                <pb facs="0751" n="739" xml:id="pg739"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">C.P.(Gen)Doc.1.U.5.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Section IV</hi></head>
                <dateline>
                    <date ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-outside-research" calendar="gregorian"
                        notAfter="1946-10-15T23:59:59+01:00" notBefore="1946-07-29T00:00:00+01:00"
                        >undated</date>
                </dateline>
                <p>The heading “Yugoslavia (Special Clauses)” should be replaced by “People’s
                    Federative Republic of Yugoslavia (Special Clause).”</p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Article 11</hi></p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>In paragraph 1, line 3, the words “and 16” should be replaced by: “and
                        subject to the provisions of Article 16.”</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>Add at the end of paragraph 1: <quote rend="blockquote">
                            <p>“(<hi rendition="#italic">c</hi>) The area bounded by lines defined
                                as follows: <list>
                                    <label>1.</label>
                                    <item>45°10'15" N.—13°2'50" E.</item>
                                    <label>2.</label>
                                    <item>44°51'10" N.—13°37' E.</item>
                                    <label>3.</label>
                                    <item>44°40' N.—13°55'40" E.</item>
                                    <label>4.</label>
                                    <item>44°56'25" N.—14°18' E.</item>
                                </list></p></quote>
                    </item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
